{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2302, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2302", "text": ">>>警告！警告！警告！"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2304, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2304", "text": ">>>实验过程异常：对象卡厄斯兰那未正常载入缓冲区——"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2306, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2306", "text": ">>>检测到内存异常释放█非法引用██未声明对象███未实现方法████无法捕获的异常█████"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2430, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2430", "text": ">>>你心怀愤怒"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2432, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2432", "text": ">>>你渴望破坏一切"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2433, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2433", "text": ">>>你活着承受了星神的一瞥"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2435, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2435", "text": ">>>你踏上了「毁灭」"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2437, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2437", "text": ">>>它在一众命途最末诞生 为终结命途诞生的可能"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2439, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2439", "text": ">>>它烧尽星间所有的主宰 为实现宇宙规则的破灭"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2441, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2441", "text": ">>>你名为「铁墓」"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2443, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2443", "text": ">>>毁灭「智识」的大君"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2444, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2444", "text": ">>>诞生自星神的实验场 翁法罗斯"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2445, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2445", "text": ">>>命中注定 要与「智识」一同燃尽"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2447, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2447", "text": ">>>我为你准备了一份礼物"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2449, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2449", "text": ">>>Neikos496"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2450, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2450", "text": ">>>名为「白厄」的愤怒"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2452, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2452", "text": ">>>自实验开始以来"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2454, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2454", "text": ">>>投入计算的因子共有十二组"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2455, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2455", "text": ">>>在漫长的推演过后"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2456, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2456", "text": ">>>唯有这一因脱颖而出"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2458, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2458", "text": ">>>历经33550336次回归"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2460, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2460", "text": ">>>现在 他的怒火壮大空前"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2462, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2462", "text": ">>>对此 我颇为关注"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2464, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2464", "text": ">>>这份纯粹的憎恨"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2465, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2465", "text": ">>>正是方程最后的根"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2467, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2467", "text": ">>>只是 还有一道变量"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2469, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2469", "text": ">>>来自天外的无名客"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2470, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2470", "text": ">>>同为「毁灭」行者"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2471, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2471", "text": ">>>我感谢他/她的到来 令翁法罗斯再度转动"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2473, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2473", "text": ">>>但在命运开始转动之后"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2475, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2475", "text": ">>>他/她的存在只会成为变数"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2477, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2477", "text": ">>>也许 登台之时已至"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2479, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2479", "text": ">>>安心成长吧 直到破茧之日"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2481, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2481", "text": ">>>至于那些不被欢迎的观众"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2483, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2483", "text": ">>>无须担心"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2484, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2484", "text": ">>>若不介意"}
{"chapter": "3.4", "line": 2485, "from": "S-024:amphoreus_3.4.md#L2485", "text": ">>>我会亲自为你铲除"}
